{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2022-04-15 10:00:00', 'title': "UNION PACIFIC NAMED A BEST COMPANY FOR WOMEN BY WOMEN'S CHOICE AWARDS", 'text': "RAILROAD HIGHLIGHTED AS BEST PLACE TO WORK FOR WOMEN OVERALL, MULTICULTURAL WOMEN AND MILLENNIALS OMAHA, NEB. , APRIL 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNION PACIFIC TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS FIRST TIME BEING NAMED AS A BEST PLACE TO WORK BY THE WOMEN'S CHOICE AWARDS IN ALL THREE CATEGORIES: BEST COMPANIES FOR WOMEN, BEST COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY AND BEST COMPANIES FOR MILLENNIALS."}